WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.352 --> 00:00:13.480
Welcome to KalamDesk. In this first lesson, you will accept your invitation, choose a password, and sign in for the first time. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:14.338 --> 00:00:29.722
Your founder adds you to KalamDesk, and you receive an email called Welcome to KalamDesk. Click the button in that email, and this page opens. The link works once, and it lasts three days.

3
00:00:30.581 --> 00:00:40.637
First, choose a password. Use at least eight characters. A short sentence you will remember works well.

4
00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:48.372
Next, type the same password again, so that a typing mistake cannot lock you out.

5
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.068
Now click Set password.

6
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:59.179
Your password is saved. Click Sign in to go to the sign-in page.

7
00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:05.416
On the sign-in page, type your official company email address.

8
00:01:06.273 --> 00:01:09.945
Then type the password you just chose.

9
00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:20.756
Click Sign in. If you ever forget your password, use the Forgot password link underneath, and we will email you a new link.

10
00:01:21.616 --> 00:01:40.888
The first time, you will see a short privacy notice. It explains what KalamDesk stores about you, and why. Bank and ID details are encrypted, and only founders can open them. Read it, and click I understand and agree.

11
00:01:41.785 --> 00:01:54.385
This is My Day, your home screen. It is quiet for now, because nothing has been assigned to you yet. That is completely normal on the first day.

12
00:01:55.410 --> 00:02:05.394
The first thing to do each working day is to tap I'm in. It records your attendance. Tap I'm out when you finish.

13
00:02:06.269 --> 00:02:22.397
On the left is the menu. My Day, Daily update, Board, List and Calendar are in the first group. Scores and Challenges are under Performance, and People, Leads and Expenses are under Company.

14
00:02:23.396 --> 00:02:36.884
At the top right, the New task button adds a task. You can also press the letter N on your keyboard from any screen. The bell next to it shows your notifications.

15
00:02:37.782 --> 00:02:49.230
That is everything for your first sign-in. In the next lesson, you will learn how to run your day: marking tasks done and adding your own tasks.
